/* ===================== CONNECTED EXECUTION: bento =====================
   These six tiles are product screenshots, so their interiors use real
   product colour and real interface type rather than the page palette.
   Only the tile captions speak in the page voice. Each panel bleeds past
   the card's bottom edge and clips, which is what keeps the grid even
   without leaving dead space inside any one tile. */
#v-rr #rr-conn{
  background:linear-gradient(180deg,
    #000000 0px, #3b66d6 70px, #E8EDFF 190px, #E8EDFF 100%);
  padding:clamp(148px,12vw,196px) 0 clamp(72px,7vw,108px)}
